  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emechie y’Obotamero",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Omob 35:9-28; Yosh 20:1-9)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero Omonene Nyasae oino, arabe osiririe abanto b’ebisaku biria mogochia koegwa ense yabo, na ekero mwairire ense amo n’emechie yabo, na komenya ase chinyomba chiabo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwatanane emechie etato ase ense eyi’Omonene Nyasae oino, agochia kobaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ense eyi’Omonene Nyasae oino, agochia kobaa, moyiate ase chinsemo isato, na moroisie chinchera chikogeenda ase emechie eyio etato, erio omonto karaite oyonde mosiabano, abe ogotamera oyomo bw’emechie eyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto onde bwensi oraite oyonde mosiabano, atabwati obobisa nere, nanyaare gotamera oyomo bw’emechie eyio, na gotooria obogima bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N’ebe ng’a omonto ogeendire amo n’oyonde ase rinani kogeecha emete, na ekero aimokirie egesire, na egesire ekio gesomoke korwa ase omote, gecharare, geite omonto oria onde, omoiti oria nabo aratamere oyomo bw’emechie eyio ase ogotooria obogima bwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenyaare koba ng’a orogeendo rogochia ase omochie bw’obotamero nigo rore orotambe, na omonto oria oganetie korusia egesiomba abwatie omoiti oria, na komoikeera nchera, na ase endamwamu yaye amoite, nonya omoiti oria tagwenerete goitwa, ekiagera aitete omonto mosiabano atabwati obobisa nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio nabachiikire mwatanane emechie etato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero Omonene Nyasae oino, aragareyie orogongo rwaino robe oronene, buna arierete chisokoro chiaino eira ase ogotiana, na kobaa inwe ense yonsi eria ateebetie chisokoro chiaino ng’a n’abayee,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nainwe komoraarende na kobwata amachiiko aya nabaeire ase rituko ria reero na komwancha Omonene Nyasae oino, ase okobwatia chinchera chiaye botambe, erio nario moranyaare komenta emechie ende etato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komorakore ayio, amanyinga y’ abanto batari na komocha tabaisa goiterwa ase ense eye Omonene Nyasae oino, agochia kobaa ebe omwando oino, ase igo timokoba na komocha kw’ogoitera amanyinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korende onye omonto ogeechete omonto onde erinde amoboere na komoaka goika akwe, na magega y’ayio atamere oyomo bw’emechie eyio,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erio abagaaka b’omochie bw’omoiti oria batome abanto bamorusie korwa ase omochie oria atameire, bamobeeke ase okoboko kw’oria okorusia egesiomba ki’oyomwabo, nere aite omoiti oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa komoororera amaabera, korende morusie korwa ase Abaisraeli okomocha kw’ogoiterwa kw’amanyinga y’omonto otarenge na komocha, erinde nebe buya ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Orobebe orokoro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tobaisa gotumana orobebe ronde rwonsi rw’omogisangio oo, orwo abanto ba kare babeegete ase orogongo rw’omwando oria oraegwe ase ense eri’Omonene Nyasae oino, arakoe ebe eyao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Igoro y’okoba kirori",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonto oyomo bweka tagoisana koba kirori igoro ase omonto onde okorire ogosaria, gose ebibe binde bionsi akorire; korende ekiina nigo keranachwe ekero birori babere gose batato bakwanire oborori bwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye omonto onde okoba kirori bw’oborimo ase okogania gokorera omonto onde bobe, na komosoera,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abanto abwo babere barenge kwomana goika baachiche ase obosio bw’Omonene, ase abakuani na abagaambi abwo batenenerete ase amatuko ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagaambi goika baunenkie mono bamanye gose kirori oria nigo agosoera oyomwabo ase oborimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komoranyore ng’a n’oborimo, erio mokorere kirori oria amang’ana aria aria ere arengereretie gokorera oyomwabo. Naboigo morusie obobe borue ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bande ekero baraigwe ayio bairoke, tibakora okomocha konga buna okwo ase egati yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa komororera amaabera. Egesusuro nigo keraabe obogima ase obogima, eriso ase eriso na erino ase erino, okoboko ase okoboko na okogoro ase okogoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "DEU.20",
    "number": "20",
